# Emberheart Challenger's valiant triggers "for the first time each turn". Turn 3: Bot1's Basilisk Collar equip ability
# targets the Challenger first - the trigger exiles the top card (a Mountain) and Bot1 plays it - and then Rancor, a spell,
# targets it again the same turn: that is the second time, so nothing more is exiled (Exile is empty afterwards; the Island
# below the Mountain is drawn for turn 5, not exiled). Turn 5 is a new turn: equipping again (the Collar to the same
# creature) is the first time that turn, so it triggers again and the Forest is exiled and played. Two triggerings in all.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Emberheart Challenger
Basilisk Collar
Rancor
Mountain
Island
Forest
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

